<ComponentPreview name="p-autocomplete-1" />

## Installation

<InstallCommand
  pnpm="pnpm add @coss-sv/ui"
  shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/autocomplete.json"
/>

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import * as Autocomplete from "@coss-sv/ui/components/ui/autocomplete";
</script>

<Autocomplete.Root {items}>
  <Autocomplete.Input placeholder="Search..." />
  <Autocomplete.Popup>
    <Autocomplete.Empty>No results found.</Autocomplete.Empty>
    <Autocomplete.List>
      <Autocomplete.Collection>
        {#snippet children(item)}
          <Autocomplete.Item value={item}>{item.label}</Autocomplete.Item>
        {/snippet}
      </Autocomplete.Collection>
    </Autocomplete.List>
  </Autocomplete.Popup>
</Autocomplete.Root>
```

## API Reference

### Autocomplete.Root

Manages the input value, popup, filtering, and item collection.

### Autocomplete.Input

The text input with size, addon, trigger, and clear controls.

### Autocomplete.Popup

The positioned suggestions popup.

### Autocomplete.List

A scrollable container for suggestions.

### Autocomplete.Item

An individual selectable suggestion.

### Autocomplete.Empty

Shown when filtering returns no suggestions.

### Autocomplete.Group

Groups related suggestions.

### Autocomplete.GroupLabel

Labels a suggestion group.

### Autocomplete.Collection

Renders the filtered items through a typed snippet.

